<div id="S5.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.p8.1" class="ltx_p">To assess the generalizability in larger models, we report the evaluation loss when pre-training a Llama-7B architecture (Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5 Results and Ablations ‣ Randomized Gradient Subspaces for Efficient Large Language Model Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>). In this experiments, GrassJump outperforms GrassWalk and other baselines, highlighting the importance of thoroughly exploring model parameters and applying regularization at scale. Here, we exclude other baselines, as their performance was consistently weaker.</p>
</div>
